      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything i believed in... it's just gone. i found out the truth about the church and the people i looked up to and it just feels like the floor dropped out from under me. there's nothing left. no purpose, no meaning, just this massive empty hole where my whole life used to be. i don't even know why i'm still waking up every day.",
